From 5f88ae09fa701a66f06ff9ffb9ee45fb45c9dff7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicole Muzzin <nicole@muzz.in>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 05:47:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] script: typing edits contenteditable hosts

Keys typed into an editing host did nothing: no text, no beforeinput or
input. Characters, Enter and Backspace now run insertText (new, a
simplified version of the spec algorithm), insertParagraph and delete,
with a cancelable beforeinput and an input carrying the input type and
data (Input Events order). execCommand('insertText') works too. Editors
on Discord, X, Gmail and Notion type into contenteditable.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
